{"id":"34532d5367481591fd0e32f4da5b4f99326a74b7","url":"https://hub.baai.ac.cn/view/57557","title":"20ms把PDF变成Markdown！开源OCR神器快了近300倍 - 智源社区","site_name":"TopHub","source":"Readhub · AI","byline":"量子位\n                  2026-08-30 15:00 分享","excerpt":"Firecrawl团队推出OCR It工具，可在20毫秒内高效提取不可复制PDF中的全部文字，并精准转换为清晰Markdown格式，彻底解决传统PDF文字提取易乱码、LLM难解析的痛点。该工具由YC孵化明星项目开发，由联合创始人兼CTO Nicolas Camara宣布，显著提升文档处理效率与AI兼容性，标志着PDF内容结构化进入毫秒级新阶段。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"js_content\"><h5 data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\">文婷 发自 凹非寺</span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span><span leaf=\"\">量子位 | 公众号 QbitAI</span></h5><p><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">曾经只能手动摘取PDF文字、结果乱码一堆、LLM还看不懂的苦逼日子——</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">终于要结束了！</span></span></strong></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/f98075b8f3c4f8b5beaa4680bbda58071788073214433.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.95\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"240\" data-imgfileid=\"100431694\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/f98075b8f3c4f8b5beaa4680bbda58071788073214433.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\">Y Combinator孵化的明星项目Firecrawl团队最近放了个大招：</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">其联合创始人兼CTO Nicolas Camara宣布，他们最新开发的</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">OCR It</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">可以</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">在20ms内</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">将一份不可复制的PDF文件内的所有文字内容提炼完，并<span textstyle=\"\">将其转化成清晰的</span>Markdown格式</span><span leaf=\"\">，AI读完马上就能看懂。</span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-backh=\"494\" data-backw=\"546\" data-imgfileid=\"100431699\" data-ratio=\"0.9038785834738617\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/054bf7d9b54e75b77de0d34ad68f3fa81788073214434.webp\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1186\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/054bf7d9b54e75b77de0d34ad68f3fa81788073214434.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\">20ms是什么概念？</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">相当于</span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">你刚点完确定还没眨完眼，一份处理好的Markdown文件就已经清清爽爽地交到你手上了。</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">而且它还不需要联网，可以</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">100%Offline via Bundled Tesseract</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">这个刚刚开源的OCR工具才刚发布，<span textstyle=\"\">就</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">在GitHub上获得了热门关注。</span></span></strong></p><p><span leaf=\"\">Nicolas Camara骄傲地表示，</span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">在处理质量与Docling旗鼓相当的前提下，OCR It的处理速度比Docling快了</span>近300倍<span textstyle=\"\">！</span></span></strong></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/8d24e2ca83cf1b86a5036dba9b37afd91788073214434.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.45210084033613446\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1190\" data-backw=\"546\" data-backh=\"247\" data-imgfileid=\"100431692\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/8d24e2ca83cf1b86a5036dba9b37afd91788073214434.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\">小伙伴们测完也纷纷在X上留言：</span></p><blockquote><p><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">快，确实快得很啊！</span><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/7a9a870ce8336ec27b878f5621daf0d31788073214434.webp\" alt=\"👍\" data-ratio=\"1\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"72\" aria-label=\"👍\" data-imgfileid=\"100431698\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/7a9a870ce8336ec27b878f5621daf0d31788073214434.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></strong></p></blockquote><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/e158bb0a3a0449da000c05c8a424df7a1788073214434.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.20860927152317882\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1208\" data-backw=\"546\" data-backh=\"114\" data-imgfileid=\"100431689\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/e158bb0a3a0449da000c05c8a424df7a1788073214434.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/b8b97798cc8804ac5c7737ff56d7dd2c1788073214434.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.2825719120135364\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1182\" data-backw=\"546\" data-backh=\"154\" data-imgfileid=\"100431680\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/b8b97798cc8804ac5c7737ff56d7dd2c1788073214434.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/fbfe8db5112b5505fb82e2788896e74a1788073214434.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.23283082077051925\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1194\" data-backw=\"546\" data-backh=\"127\" data-imgfileid=\"100431695\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/fbfe8db5112b5505fb82e2788896e74a1788073214434.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></p><h2><span leaf=\"\">OCR It怎么用</span></h2><p><span leaf=\"\">首先，OCR It是一款</span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">适用于Chrome和Firefox</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\">的免费浏览器插件。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">你只需框选一次区域，之后每按一次快捷键<span textstyle=\"\">（或开启自动模式）</span>，它就能把整本书或整个文档变成完整且可编辑的纯文本，方便你直接喂给AI进行总结或提问。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">期间，</span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">OCR It会默认在连续识别到两张相同页面、无法继续翻页、OCR失败或达到300页上限时自动停止</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\">，避免在末页无限重复抓取。</span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/f66917c336824d04b0b6142ebdc708f61788073214434.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.6691042047531993\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1094\" data-backw=\"546\" data-backh=\"365\" data-imgfileid=\"100431697\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/f66917c336824d04b0b6142ebdc708f61788073214434.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\">具体而言，手动和自动档可以分别按以下的几个步骤操作：</span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span><em><span leaf=\"\">（注：用Windows和Linux的小伙伴们需将option键替换为Alt）</span></em></p><p><span leaf=\"\">1、手动档：</span></p><ul><li><strong><span leaf=\"\">框选和识别：</span></strong><strong><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></strong></li></ul><p data-pm-slice=\"3 2 []\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">首先按</span><span textstyle=\"\">Option+Shift+R</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\">选定需要识别的文字区域，</span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">确认无误后按Enter保存</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\">；</span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"3 2 []\"><span leaf=\"\">完成第一步框选文字区域之后，按一次<span textstyle=\"\">Option+Shift+S</span>，OCR It就会开始识别当前页面，并在识别完成后会自动翻到下一页。</span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"3 2 []\"><span leaf=\"\">接下来你只需要重复这个操作直到整份文档识别完毕就好了。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">如果你希望进一步节省时间的话，</span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">你也可以一边翻页一边在每一页按一次Option+Shift+S，系统会立即截图并在后台自动排队执行识别任务。</span></span></strong></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/fd2a60e9098d21639fadbb6049be7dad1788073214435.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5467196819085487\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1006\" data-imgfileid=\"100431693\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/fd2a60e9098d21639fadbb6049be7dad1788073214435.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><ul><li><strong><span leaf=\"\">检查：</span></strong><section><span leaf=\"\">全部识别完成后，你可以在插件面板中检查、修改文本，也可以重新识别单独某一页，最后选择</span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">“Copy all”</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">或</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">“Download .txt”</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\">导出全文，整个任务就完成啦！</span></section></li></ul><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/e766ef4f0a7b88204332a7ed317fcb121788073214435.webp\" data-ratio=\"1.53475935828877\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"748\" data-backw=\"546\" data-backh=\"838\" data-imgfileid=\"100431696\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/e766ef4f0a7b88204332a7ed317fcb121788073214435.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\">2、</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">自动档</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">：</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">自动挡的话就简单多了，你只需要按下</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">Option+Shift+A<span textstyle=\"\">或</span>点击Start auto-run</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">，OCR It便会自动循环执行“截图—OCR—翻页”，直至文档结束。</span></p><p><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">如果你想中途结束任务的话，按ESC就行</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\">，检查流程几乎和手动档一致。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">此外，OCR It仓库界面显示，</span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">它既不需要API Key、联网、安装时也不需要索取任何网站权限，它只会在需要自动运行或操作跨域iframe时才按需申请当前站点的权限。</span></span></strong></p><p><span leaf=\"\">另外，浏览器内置PDF阅读器目前也还暂时不支持自动翻页，所以大家在处理这类PDF时，还是尽量用手动档处理吧。</span></p><h2><span leaf=\"\">处理复杂任务时还不太稳定</span></h2><p><span leaf=\"\">不过，OCR It虽然看起来又快又方便，但</span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">还远没有到“以后把所有PDF都丢给它，就能高枕无忧”的程度。</span></span></strong></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/e45fc197e7ef93096a2d809068bd41bf1788073214435.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.9915966386554622\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"238\" data-imgfileid=\"100431690\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/e45fc197e7ef93096a2d809068bd41bf1788073214435.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\">网友们通过实测达成的一个共识是：</span></p><blockquote><p><span leaf=\"\">OCR It目前可以相当顺手地处理版式简单、文字清晰的PDF文档，但它</span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">还不太能处理一些标题、脚注、表格、数学公式和正文段落混排的复杂页面</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\">，所以它还有不小的提升空间。</span></p></blockquote><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/bffcf39bd678a1f24a13514a692d78551788073214435.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.625\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1184\" data-backw=\"546\" data-backh=\"341\" data-imgfileid=\"100431691\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/bffcf39bd678a1f24a13514a692d78551788073214435.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\">让我们期待一下团队后续的更新吧！</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">感兴趣的小伙伴们可以点进文末第二个链接看看，欢迎跟我们分享你的测试结果～<img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/47c3666da40edcbaa02af581df10698d1788073214435.webp\" alt=\"👇\" data-ratio=\"1\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"72\" aria-label=\"👇\" data-imgfileid=\"100431683\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/47c3666da40edcbaa02af581df10698d1788073214435.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">参考链接：</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">[1]https://x.com/nickscamara_/status/2083295265793212827</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">[2]https://github.com/thiagotigaz/ocr-it</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">[3]https://www.firecrawl.dev/about</span></span></p><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section><section><p><strong><span leaf=\"\">一键三连</span></strong><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">「点赞」「转发」「小心心」</span></strong></span></p><p><strong><span leaf=\"\">欢迎在评论区留下你的想法！</span></strong></p></section><section><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1 1\" style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\" /></section></section><section><p><span><span leaf=\"\">—&#160;</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">完</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">&#160;—</span></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span leaf=\"\">🌟 点亮星标 🌟</span></strong></p><section><strong><span leaf=\"\">科技前沿进展每日见</span></strong></section></section></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><mp-common-profile data-pluginname=\"mpprofile\" data-nickname=\"量子位\" data-alias=\"QbitAI\" data-from=\"0\" data-headimg=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YicUhk5aAGtCEFSVW5ubo08Zfv1qB5iapricibTBdETkBNtolJxnSUib6UXhjWWz3aib8vETY00P2lKR1uG3qLHicSoWg/0?wx_fmt=png\" data-signature=\"追踪人工智能新趋势，关注科技行业新突破\" data-id=\"MzIzNjc1NzUzMw==\" data-is_biz_ban=\"0\" data-service_type=\"1\"></mp-common-profile></span></section></div></DIV>","content_text":"文婷 发自 凹非寺量子位 | 公众号 QbitAI曾经只能手动摘取PDF文字、结果乱码一堆、LLM还看不懂的苦逼日子——终于要结束了！Y Combinator孵化的明星项目Firecrawl团队最近放了个大招：其联合创始人兼CTO Nicolas Camara宣布，他们最新开发的OCR It可以在20ms内将一份不可复制的PDF文件内的所有文字内容提炼完，并将其转化成清晰的Markdown格式，AI读完马上就能看懂。20ms是什么概念？相当于你刚点完确定还没眨完眼，一份处理好的Markdown文件就已经清清爽爽地交到你手上了。而且它还不需要联网，可以100%Offline via Bundled Tesseract。这个刚刚开源的OCR工具才刚发布，就在GitHub上获得了热门关注。Nicolas Camara骄傲地表示，在处理质量与Docling旗鼓相当的前提下，OCR It的处理速度比Docling快了近300倍！小伙伴们测完也纷纷在X上留言：快，确实快得很啊！OCR It怎么用首先，OCR It是一款适用于Chrome和Firefox的免费浏览器插件。你只需框选一次区域，之后每按一次快捷键（或开启自动模式），它就能把整本书或整个文档变成完整且可编辑的纯文本，方便你直接喂给AI进行总结或提问。期间，OCR It会默认在连续识别到两张相同页面、无法继续翻页、OCR失败或达到300页上限时自动停止，避免在末页无限重复抓取。具体而言，手动和自动档可以分别按以下的几个步骤操作：（注：用Windows和Linux的小伙伴们需将option键替换为Alt）1、手动档：框选和识别：首先按Option+Shift+R选定需要识别的文字区域，确认无误后按Enter保存；完成第一步框选文字区域之后，按一次Option+Shift+S，OCR It就会开始识别当前页面，并在识别完成后会自动翻到下一页。接下来你只需要重复这个操作直到整份文档识别完毕就好了。如果你希望进一步节省时间的话，你也可以一边翻页一边在每一页按一次Option+Shift+S，系统会立即截图并在后台自动排队执行识别任务。检查：全部识别完成后，你可以在插件面板中检查、修改文本，也可以重新识别单独某一页，最后选择“Copy all”或“Download .txt”导出全文，整个任务就完成啦！2、自动档：自动挡的话就简单多了，你只需要按下Option+Shift+A或点击Start auto-run，OCR It便会自动循环执行“截图—OCR—翻页”，直至文档结束。如果你想中途结束任务的话，按ESC就行，检查流程几乎和手动档一致。此外，OCR It仓库界面显示，它既不需要API Key、联网、安装时也不需要索取任何网站权限，它只会在需要自动运行或操作跨域iframe时才按需申请当前站点的权限。另外，浏览器内置PDF阅读器目前也还暂时不支持自动翻页，所以大家在处理这类PDF时，还是尽量用手动档处理吧。处理复杂任务时还不太稳定不过，OCR It虽然看起来又快又方便，但还远没有到“以后把所有PDF都丢给它，就能高枕无忧”的程度。网友们通过实测达成的一个共识是：OCR It目前可以相当顺手地处理版式简单、文字清晰的PDF文档，但它还不太能处理一些标题、脚注、表格、数学公式和正文段落混排的复杂页面，所以它还有不小的提升空间。让我们期待一下团队后续的更新吧！感兴趣的小伙伴们可以点进文末第二个链接看看，欢迎跟我们分享你的测试结果～参考链接：[1]https://x.com/nickscamara_/status/2083295265793212827[2]https://github.com/thiagotigaz/ocr-it[3]https://www.firecrawl.dev/about一键三连「点赞」「转发」「小心心」欢迎在评论区留下你的想法！— 完 —🌟 点亮星标 🌟科技前沿进展每日见","fetched_at":"2026-08-31T08:35:21.959Z","ok":true}